list.item:

    Roth, William M., Deputy
Special Representative for Trade Negotiations until March 24, 1967;
thereafter Special Representative

person.note:
Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for Economic Affairs until October 1965;
                    Representative to the Organization for European Economic Cooperation from
                    October 26, 1965

Assistant Secretary of Commerce for Domestic and International Business until
                    May 1967; Acting Secretary of Commerce, February 1, 1967–June 14, 1967;
                    Secretary, June 14, 1967–February 28, 1968
